identical      : identical to CODEX.CDX, 4 bytes
byte differs   : DIFFERS from CODEX.CDX at byte 2, produced 4 bytes, on volume 4 bytes
first byte     : DIFFERS from CODEX.CDX at byte 0, produced 4 bytes, on volume 4 bytes
produced short : DIFFERS from CODEX.CDX at byte 2, produced 2 bytes, on volume 4 bytes
produced long  : DIFFERS from CODEX.CDX at byte 4, produced 5 bytes, on volume 4 bytes
produced none  : DIFFERS from CODEX.CDX at byte 0, produced 0 bytes, on volume 4 bytes
both empty     : identical to CODEX.CDX, 0 bytes
done
